# Jomarkhata frontend — environment variables
#
# No environment variables are required yet: the app currently runs fully
# offline on the device (IndexedDB). Variables such as NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL and
# the Firebase web config will be added here (blank) when the backend and
# authentication phases actually need them.

# Helpline WhatsApp number shown as "সাহায্য দরকার? WhatsApp-এ লিখুন" (public, not a secret).
# Bangladeshi mobile, e.g. 01712345678. Leave empty to hide the button.
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPPORT_WHATSAPP=
